graph TB
    User[User Query] --> Compaction[compaction_node<br/>F4: pass-through if no<br/>compaction needed]
    Compaction --> Router[router_node_v3]

    Router --> RouterDecision{Routing Decision<br/>conversation / actionable<br/>/ ReAct mode}

    RouterDecision -->|"response"<br/>Conversational| ResponseNode[response_node]
    RouterDecision -->|"react"<br/>ADR-070 user-toggled| ReactSetup[react_setup_node]
    RouterDecision -->|"planner"<br/>Actionable| SkillCheck{Skill Match?}

    SkillCheck -->|"Yes — deterministic<br/>SkillBypassStrategy"| TaskOrchestrator
    SkillCheck -->|"No"| PlannerNode[planner_node_v3]

    PlannerNode --> SmartPlanner[SmartPlannerService<br/>Generate ExecutionPlan<br/>PlanPatternLearner cache<br/>Bayesian, Redis]
    SmartPlanner --> PlanReady{Plan Analysis}

    PlanReady -->|Empty Plan| ResponseNode
    PlanReady -->|Requires Validation| SemanticValidator[semantic_validator_node]
    PlanReady -->|Direct Execution| TaskOrchestrator[task_orchestrator_node]

    SemanticValidator --> ValidationCheck{Validation Result}
    ValidationCheck -->|Requires Clarification| Clarification[clarification_node<br/>HITL Interrupt]
    ValidationCheck -->|Needs Replan| PlannerNode
    ValidationCheck -->|Valid / Max Iterations| ApprovalGate[approval_gate_node<br/>currently auto-approve<br/>pass-through — tool-level<br/>HITL supersedes]

    Clarification -->|User clarifies| SemanticValidator

    ApprovalGate -->|Approved| TaskOrchestrator
    ApprovalGate -->|Replan| PlannerNode
    ApprovalGate -->|Rejected| ResponseNode

    TaskOrchestrator --> ExecutePlan[ParallelExecutor<br/>Wave-by-wave asyncio.gather]

    ExecutePlan -->|"Pending draft<br/>(requires_confirmation)"| HITLDispatch[hitl_dispatch_node<br/>Draft Critique / Modifier Review<br/>ADR-092: one interrupt per<br/>node execution, self-loop]
    ExecutePlan -->|"FOR_EACH bulk mutation"| ForEachConfirm[for_each_confirm_node<br/>ADR-092: providers pre-executed<br/>once, approve resumes,<br/>edit self-loops]

    HITLDispatch -->|Draft still pending| HITLDispatch
    HITLDispatch -->|Terminal decision| Initiative

    ForEachConfirm -->|Edit — filtered list| ForEachConfirm
    ForEachConfirm -->|Approved| TaskOrchestrator
    ForEachConfirm -->|Cancelled| Initiative

    ExecutePlan --> DomainAgents
    ExecutePlan --> SubAgentDelegation

    subgraph SubAgentDelegation["Sub-Agent Delegation (ADR-083)"]
        direction TB
        DelegateTool["delegate_to_sub_agent_tool"] --> OneShot["One-shot expert LLM call<br/>persona + expertise written by<br/>the principal, all data inlined<br/>— no tools, no graph"]
    end

    subgraph DomainAgents["Graph Domain Agent Nodes"]
        direction LR
        subgraph OAuthAgents["OAuth (Google / Apple / Microsoft)"]
            ContactAgent[contact]
            EmailAgent[email]
            EventAgent[event]
            FileAgent[file]
            TaskAgent[task]
        end
        subgraph APIKeyAgents["API Key"]
            WeatherAgent[weather]
            WikiAgent[wikipedia]
            PerplexityAgent[perplexity]
            PlaceAgent[place]
            RouteAgent[route]
        end
        subgraph SmartHome["Smart Home & Browser"]
            HueAgent[hue]
            BrowserAgent["browser (F7,<br/>conditional)"]
        end
    end

    DomainAgents --> Initiative[initiative_node<br/>ADR-062: post-execution evaluation,<br/>optional read-only actions,<br/>ADR-091: response-context prefetch]
    SubAgentDelegation --> Initiative

    Initiative -->|Re-evaluate after actions| Initiative
    Initiative --> ResponseFinal[response_node]

    subgraph ReactMode["ReAct Execution Mode (ADR-070)"]
        direction TB
        ReactSetup --> ReactCallModel[react_call_model_node]
        ReactCallModel -->|Tool calls| ReactExecuteTools[react_execute_tools_node]
        ReactExecuteTools -->|Loop back| ReactCallModel
        ReactCallModel -->|Done| ReactFinalize[react_finalize_node]
    end

    ReactExecuteTools -->|"Draft requiring confirmation<br/>(shared HITL dispatch)"| HITLDispatch
    ReactFinalize -->|"INITIATIVE_REACT_ENABLED"| Initiative
    ReactFinalize --> ResponseFinal

    ResponseNode --> UserResponse[AI Response to User<br/>SSE streaming]
    ResponseFinal --> UserResponse

    UserResponse --> End([END])

    style Compaction fill:#f5f5f5
    style Router fill:#e1f5ff
    style SmartPlanner fill:#fff4e1
    style SemanticValidator fill:#e1ffe1
    style Clarification fill:#ffe1e1
    style ApprovalGate fill:#ffcccc
    style TaskOrchestrator fill:#e1ffe1
    style HITLDispatch fill:#ffe1e1
    style ForEachConfirm fill:#ffe1e1
    style DomainAgents fill:#f0e1ff
    style SkillCheck fill:#fff9e1
    style SubAgentDelegation fill:#e1fff5
    style DelegateTool fill:#e1fff5
    style OneShot fill:#e1fff5
    style ReactMode fill:#e8f0fe
    style Initiative fill:#fff4e1
